><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1708940279825264674":{"a":"<p>Sitting in the lobby of Eskenazi hospital after a day of testing. Looks like my sacrum is broken. Has been for a very long time. That tracks. t.co</p>\n<p><a href=\"1708940279825264674-UybJTXjO5vSv14R0.mp4\">video</a></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1708940279825264674</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1708940279825264674\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-02T20:21:27Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1708941207420940523":{"a":"<p>That might give you a hint why so many humans are changing genders. Something outside of their control might be influencing them, no? Some hidden, unseen force that isn&#x27;t a politician or whatever ghost haunt&#x27;s your mind. Maybe figure out what&#x27;s really wrong before you attack, no?</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1708941207420940523</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1708941207420940523\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-02T20:25:09Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1708960582181728371":{"a":"<p>@ArtByAlida The pain is bearable most days but only because I&#x27;m used to it. Some highschool kids threw me on the ground and stomped my rib cage and face when I was about 7. Diaphragm paralysis et al. Looks like arthritis is catching up enough the injury is affecting my ability to walk also.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ArtByAlida/status/1708959601146667393\">https://x.com/ArtByAlida/status/1708959601146667393</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1708960582181728371</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1708960582181728371\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-02T21:42:08Z</dd><