849195321323727\">Tweet by @tinyklaus</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/tinyklaus/status/1708849195321323727\">https://x.com/tinyklaus/status/1708849195321323727</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1708962848422928749</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1708962848422928749\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-02T21:51:08Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1708963664814891089":{"a":"<p>@ArtByAlida The means by which your data is stored on device has changed in recent times. It might be that your usual procedures are now missing something they previous did not. Not sure what specifically might be the issue but &quot;delete all data&quot; should resync from your browser&#x27;s cloud setup.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ArtByAlida/status/1708952966080688301\">https://x.com/ArtByAlida/status/1708952966080688301</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1708963664814891089</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1708963664814891089\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-02T21:54:23Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1708964076234100779":{"a":"<p>They certainly have the patience to get things right. You don&#x27;t get to make too many mistakes on the way to the moon. <a href=\"https://x.com/JohnMPowell1/status/1708867643804139710\">Tweet by @JohnMPowell1</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/JohnMPowell1/status/1708867643804139710\">https://x.com/JohnMPowell1/status/1708867643804139710</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1708964076234100779</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1708964076234100779\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-02T